{"h":"<h3><u>英语不好！</u><strong><u></u></strong></h3><p>有关基本的文本到图像工作流程，请参阅版本 1.0。后两个版本是根据个人喜好定制的。</p><h3><strong><em>2.01-个人偏好工作流程共享</em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece/width=525/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>好吧，我知道这看起来并不简单——请视为我分享一个概念方法。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3/width=525/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f/width=525/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>目前我使用三种模型生成图像：Noob-v 用于初始预测，中继到 MiaoMiao harem，然后在升级后使用 NTR 重新生成。工艺流程如上。这是因为Noob-v在光照/阴影控制方面表现出色，喵喵产生了优越的肢体结构，而我更喜欢NTR的服装/面部纹理渲染——纯粹的主观视角。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078/width=525/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>我使用大量 LoRA 来生成图像，由于这是一个三模型工作流程，因此 LoRA 列表显得很广泛。但您可能不需要这么多 - 因此将它们全部删除就完全可以了。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c/width=525/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd/width=525/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">-</em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42/width=525/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>我个人更喜欢多步骤生成过程，类似于图像到图像的工作流程，您可以在过程中调整标签和 LoRA。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062/width=525/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13/width=525/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e/width=525/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong><em></em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad/width=525/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3></h3><p><em>使用Comfyui一段时间了，感觉确实比Weibu好用。</em></p><p><em>这次我突发奇想想出了一个新的放大方法。我觉得这很有趣，所以我想分享一下工作流程。</em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048/width=525/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288/width=525/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f/width=525/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3><h3></h3><p>右下角的是二次放大的正面标签。可以自己修改，就像微步一样<em>img2img-图像</em>。最上面的是lora与基础模型串联进行二次放大。<br></p><h3></h3><p><em>我不会详细介绍重绘和controlnet。谈起来太麻烦了。</em></p><p><em>不过我想你应该能明白这里吧...QAQ</em></p><h3></h3><h1><em>很生气！<img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70/width=525/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910/width=525/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></h1><h3></h3><p><em>脚好脚坏，不开心，我知道我的艺人标签和lora受到了一定程度的污染，所以我就想办法解决。</em></p><h3><br></h3><p><em>和微步的img2img-images类似，你先给一个底图，然后你可以添加或减去标签和loras来控制绘图的风格和细节。</em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce/width=525/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><em>这是没有trt风格的少女身材</em></h3><h3></h3><p><em>一个简单的例子：我想要一个trt风格的人体，但我觉得它有点油腻。我可以用这个方法在高清放大时用其他风格的lora改变风格。</em></p><h3><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6/width=525/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></h3><p><br><em>可以看到脚趾效果有所改善...因为我去掉了一些艺术家标签，换成了其他款式 lora</em></p><h3></h3><p><em>还有这种原版lora过于程式化，导致放大后效果不佳。</em></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35/width=525/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6/width=525/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2/width=525/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3></h3><p><em>只需简单地降低新创建的二级放大节点中角色lora的强度并更改lora的风格即可</em></p><h3><strong></strong></h3><p><em>嗯……在最右边，我忘记用艾伦·乔的触发标签替换黑暗标签，但这也很酷。</em></p><h3></h3><p><em>所以我认为你和你应该能够理解这种放大的好处以及它的应用场合。</em></p><h3><br></h3><p><em>我的工作流程只是想创建简单的性爱图片，仅此而已</em><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250/width=525/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h3><strong><em>1.0</em></strong></h3><p>我最近学习了comfyui，有时我只是想要一些非常简单的功能，但是网站上其他人上传的工作流程对于我这个新手来说太复杂或者不包含我的需求，所以我创建了这个工作流程。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb/width=525/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><ul><li><p><strong><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925/width=525/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">单独的负标签用于控制放大倍数</strong></p></li><li><p><strong></strong></p></li></ul><p>我喜欢使用多个LORA，也许你不需要那么多，所以你可以自己删除绿色部分</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630/width=525/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>这两个LORA是用来控制角色的</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29/width=525/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>如果您觉得没问题，请上传图片并告诉我</p><p>/////</p><p>参考工作流程</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/364333/comfyui-face-eyes-and-lips-adetailer-flow-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/364333/comfyui-face-eyes-and-lips-adetailer-flow-tutorial</a></p><p><br></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h3><u>English is not good！</u><strong><u></u></strong></h3><p>For the basic text-to-image workflow, see version 1.0. The latter two versions are customized according to personal preferences.</p><h3><strong><em>2.01-Personal Preference Workflow Sharing</em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece/width=525/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Alright, I know this doesn't appear to be simple – please regard it as me sharing a conceptual approach.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3/width=525/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f/width=525/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Currently I generate images using three models: Noob-v for initial prediction, relay to MiaoMiao harem, then re-generate with NTR after upscaling. Process flow as above. This is because Noob-v excels in lighting/shading control, MiaoMiao produces superior limb structures, and I prefer NTR's clothing/facial texture rendering - purely subjective perspective.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078/width=525/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>I use numerous LoRAs for image generation, and since this is a three-model workflow, the LoRA list appears extensive. But you probably don't need this many - so it's perfectly fine to remove them all.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c/width=525/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd/width=525/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">-</em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42/width=525/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>The multi-step generation process, similar to image-to-image workflows where you can adjust tags and LoRAs mid-process, is what I personally prefer.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062/width=525/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13/width=525/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e/width=525/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong><em></em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad/width=525/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3></h3><p><em>I have been using Comfyui for a while and I feel it is indeed easier to use than Weibu.</em></p><p><em>This time, I came up with a new amplification method on a whim. I thought it was quite interesting, so I would like to share the workflow.</em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048/width=525/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288/width=525/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f/width=525/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3><h3></h3><p>The one in the lower right corner is the front tag for secondary enlargement. You can modify it by yourself, just like Weibu<em>img2img-images</em>. The top one is the lora connected in series with the base model for secondary enlargement.<br></p><h3></h3><p><em>I won’t go into details about redrawing and controlnet. It’s too troublesome to talk about.</em></p><p><em>But I think you can understand it here... QAQ</em></p><h3></h3><h1><em>very angry !<img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70/width=525/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910/width=525/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></h1><h3></h3><p><em>feet good feet bad, unhappy,I knew that my artist tag and lora were contaminated to a certain extent, so I thought of a way to solve it.</em></p><h3><br></h3><p><em>Similar to Weibu's img2img-images, you first give a base map, and then you can add or subtract tags and loras to control the style and details of the drawing.</em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce/width=525/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><em>This is girl body without trt style</em></h3><h3></h3><p><em>A simple example: I want a trt style human body but I think it is a bit oily. I can use this method to change the style with other style lora when zooming in in high definition.</em></p><h3><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6/width=525/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></h3><p><br><em>You can see that the toe effect has improved... because I removed some artist tags and changed to other styles lora</em></p><h3></h3><p><em>There is also this kind of original lora that is too stylized, resulting in poor effect after enlargement.</em></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35/width=525/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6/width=525/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2/width=525/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3></h3><p><em>Just simply lower the intensity of the character lora in the newly created secondary amplification node and change the style lora</em></p><h3><strong></strong></h3><p><em>emmm...and on the far right, I forgot to replace the darkness tag with Ellen Joe's trigger tag, but it's pretty cool too.</em></p><h3></h3><p><em>So I think you you and you should be able to understand the benefits of this amplification and where it is applied.</em></p><h3><br></h3><p><em>My workflow just wants to create simple sex pictures, that's it</em><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250/width=525/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h3><strong><em>1.0</em></strong></h3><p>I recently learned comfyui and sometimes I just want some very simple features, but the workflows uploaded by others on the site are too complicated for me as a newbies or don't include my needs, so I created this workflow.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb/width=525/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><ul><li><p><strong><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925/width=525/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">A separate Negative tag is used to control magnification</strong></p></li><li><p><strong></strong></p></li></ul><p>I love using more than one LORA, maybe you don't need that many, so you can delete the green part yourself</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630/width=525/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>These two LORAs are used to control the character</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29/width=525/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>If you find it OK, please upload pictures and let me know</p><p>/////</p><p>Reference workflow</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/364333/comfyui-face-eyes-and-lips-adetailer-flow-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/364333/comfyui-face-eyes-and-lips-adetailer-flow-tutorial</a></p><p><br></p>","zh":"<h3><u></u><strong><u>英语不��警告！</u></strong></h3><p>1.0是相对简洁的单文生图流程 后面的版本都是个人喜好一些思路分享</p><h3><strong><em></em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece/width=525/d03fb095-3a7a-4ebd-898a-4e81a5f17ece.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">好吧 看上去好像复杂了很多 之前有人问 我就整理了下发了出来 就当我是在分享一个思路吧</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3/width=525/8ecf7ab7-3bf0-4d0b-b6c3-624ffa2818c3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f/width=525/e08e0c7a-25b0-4e79-bd68-0654a07f686f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">现在我是用三个模型来生成图 Noob-v预测 接力 MiaoMiao harem 最后放大完用ntr过一遍出图 流程如上。 因为我感觉Noob-v预测系列的光影明暗要好 Miaomiao的肢体 (Jio) 要好 以及我喜欢ntr的衣物跟表情的质感，当然 这只是纯个人见解。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078/width=525/a4ad2af7-af9e-4de3-881d-4281789fc078.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">单一模型生图→双模型接力 1model→ 2model</p><p>我生图用的lora比较多 而且这里是三个模型的流程 所以lora看起来非常多 但你们也许并不需要这么多 所以都删掉也ok.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c/width=525/0e2f8384-5f07-4a10-b1c4-10c695b0955c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd/width=525/336844c9-0357-49ec-a35c-4e6254077fbd.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42/width=525/bea9b18c-f4df-466a-a74e-2db612d84a42.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>生成步骤分的多 就像图生图那样 可以中间单独调整tag跟lora 我还是比较喜欢这样的。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062/width=525/e8f4b7a7-b74b-4194-a4b0-14ede967d062.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13/width=525/277561ff-d0f9-4453-b61f-7446f0903f13.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e/width=525/5141d5e2-cd8a-4c63-b076-65dba04d985e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">是的 我就是为了jio跟袜子 ///</p><h3><strong><em>2.0</em></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad/width=525/edc98a20-ba7c-41b3-8a4b-80f79fda50ad.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3>也用了段时间的Comfyui 感觉确实比weibu好用，这次突发奇想折腾出个新的放大方法感觉挺有意思就顺便分享一下工作流</h3><p><em></em></p><p><em></em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048/width=525/d94b2ab5-ed2c-4521-bd79-c59d5c07e048.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288/width=525/01f812d1-4557-4e12-a4ab-fdd308e09288.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f/width=525/b1d30708-9f10-4733-86cb-e8259944bf7f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3><h3>最右下角的那个是二次放大用的正面tag 可以自己修改折腾 就像weibu的图生图那样，最上面的是二次放大 基底模型串联起来的lora。</h3><p><em></em><br></p><h3>重绘 跟controlnet那边就不细说了 说起来太麻烦 但我觉得这里也看得懂吧.... QAQ</h3><p><em></em></p><p><em></em></p><h3>这次主要是跑图的时候被气到了</h3><h1><em><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70/width=525/b09eab03-c770-4cc5-900b-9e4bbc6f8f70.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910/width=525/46545ab0-279f-4488-be78-2bf02398e910.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></h1><h3>何意啊！！ 底图的脚这么好 怎么放大就一坨了！ 我知道是我的画师tag跟lora有一定程度上的污染 所以我就想了个办法来解决</h3><p><em></em></p><h3><br>类似于weibu的图生图流程 先给一个底图 然后图生图那边就可以增减tag 和lora来控制出图的风格跟细节</h3><p><em></em></p><h3><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce/width=525/6a1c60ac-b3dc-4ffa-8f52-3aa2aa7e8fce.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">这是没用trt style的人体<em></em></h3><h3>简单的一个例子 我想要trt style的人体 但是我觉得他有点油 我就可以用这种方法在高清放大的时候用其他style lora来换种风格</h3><p><em></em></p><h3><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6/width=525/6206d8c6-8f27-42a4-bbda-2e75ca7279a6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>你可以看到 脚趾的效果变好了..... 因为我去除了一些画师tag以及更换了别的style lora。</h3><p><br><em></em></p><h3>还有这种原lora风格化太强 导致放大后效果不佳的</h3><p><em></em></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35/width=525/a3766e3e-1d9b-4319-8d1d-7d0fcb50bd35.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6/width=525/2473940a-aefc-49d9-af3b-8860aafce7c6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2/width=525/643ceff1-14c2-4f92-bc48-28dd2a7e30a2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3>只是简单的在新建的二次放大节点把角色lora的强度调低了点并换了个style lora</h3><p><em></em></p><h3>emmm...以及最右边的我忘了把<strong>darkness的tag换成Ellen Joe的触发tag了 但也挺好看的</strong></h3><p><em></em></p><h3>所以我想大伙应该能够理解这种放大的好处以及应用在哪</h3><p><em></em></p><h3><br>我的工作流只想简单涩涩 嗯 就这样</h3><p><em></em><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250/width=525/9924e450-4d2d-4864-8ab5-8a44e7273250.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p><h3><strong><em></em></strong></h3><p>我就想要简简单单生图放大涩涩</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb/width=525/e846c55b-05ce-45df-b49d-a1a17e8b2afb.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><ul><li><p><strong><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925/width=525/122a1073-4990-42df-8cb4-f1557657a925.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p></li><li><p><strong>放大用单独的tag就可以做到力大砖飞了 ((((((((BAD FOOT)))))))) 对....对吗....</strong></p></li></ul><p>lora用的多 可以删 删完记得连连看就行了</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630/width=525/44d52f1e-6634-48cf-8d97-d6c619e98630.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>这两个放角色</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29/width=525/2a928a2b-32ce-446a-9f6b-0ec7b8b0cd29.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/364333/comfyui-face-eyes-and-lips-adetailer-flow-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"></a></p><p><br></p>"}}